万别把这件事告诉莱卡，不...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1310309004:1":{"key":"say:5:1310309004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你怎么会在这里恶作剧吓唬别人？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1310309005:0":{"key":"say:6:1310309005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我之前给你们写过信说要来北方游历呀！我在路上听到一些商...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1310309006:0":{"key":"say:7:1310309006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"至于刚才嘛……我只是在给这位美丽的老板娘打工而已，毕竟...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1310309007:1":{"key":"say:10:1310309007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哈哈，这位客人被吓到了吗？是不是很刺激？这可是我们为了...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1310309008:1":{"key":"say:11:1310309008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"看来还是挺有效果……啊，抱歉抱歉，不要介意哦。祭典嘛，...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1310309009:1":{"key":"say:12:1310309009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"其实……一点也不可怕！嗯，满满刚才只是没准备好……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:13:1310309009":{"key":"choice_prompt:13:1310309009","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1310309009","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"其实……一点也不可怕！嗯，满满刚才只是没准备好……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1310309010:1":{"key":"say:14:1310309010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"亲爱的，刚才的只能算是个“小惊吓”，一盘开胃前菜而已。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1310309011:1":{"key":"say:15:1310309011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"忘了自我介绍，我是这里的老板娘格尔达。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:18:1310309012:1":{"key":"say:18:1310309012:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"18","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309012","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"咦，格尔达女士，为什么这家店的名字要叫“白熊温泉旅店”呢？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:19:1310309013:1":{"key":"say:19:1310309013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"19","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哈哈哈，亲爱的，因为我最好的朋友是位可爱的白熊女士。可...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:20:1310309014:1":{"key":"say:20:1310309014:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"20","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309014","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我明白了！所以你就用她的名字在这里开了家旅店，对吧？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:21:1310309015:1":{"key":"say:21:1310309015:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"21","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309015","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"正是这样，亲爱的。要是你们有机会去我家乡一趟，就会发现...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:22:1310309016:1":{"key":"say:22:1310309016:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"22","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309016","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"哇，真是令人羡慕的友情！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:23:1310309017:1":{"key":"say:23:1310309017:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"23","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310309017","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"好啦，大家随我来吧，接下来的才是真正的大餐呢！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"key":"choice:13:0:1","kind":"choice","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1310309001","action_index":"","choice_index":"0","choice_id":"1","source_cn":"这就是“鬼影密室”项目？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"key":"choice:13:1:2